entries[115049] = { ["name"] = "Primal Combatant's Dreadplate Chestpiece", ["text"] = "Warlords Season 1\nBinds when picked up\nChest Plate\n17 Armor\n+5 [Strength or Intellect]\n+7 Stamina\n+ 5 Critical Strike\n+ 5 Haste\nDurability 140 / 140\nClasses: Death Knight\nRequires any Alliance race\nGladiator's Desecration (0/5)\nGladiator's Dreadplate Chestpiece\nGladiator's Dreadplate Helm\nGladiator's Dreadplate Gauntlets\nGladiator's Dreadplate Shoulders\nGladiator's Dreadplate Legguards\n(2) Set Blood: Using Death Grip increases the damage of your next weapon special attack by 25%. (2) Set Frost: Using Death Grip increases the damage of your next weapon special attack by 25%. (2) Set Unholy: Using Death Grip increases the damage of your next weapon special attack by 25%.\n(4) Set Blood: Anti-Magic Shell also applies to the nearest ally.\n(4) Set Frost: When you have Rime active, your next Howling Blast will increase Frost damage taken on all targets by 10% for 8 sec.\n(4) Set Unholy: When you activate Dark Transformation, your Shadow damage dealt is increased by 20% for 15 sec.\nSell Price:" }
