entries[115535] = { ["name"] = "Ogreskull Boneplate Greaves", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nLegs Plate\n15 Armor\n+5 [Strength or Intellect]\n+7 Stamina\n+ 5 Critical Strike\n+ 5 Mastery\nDurability 120 / 120\nClasses: Death Knight\nOgreskull Boneplate Battlegear (0/5)\nOgreskull Boneplate Greaves\nOgreskull Boneplate Pauldrons\nOgreskull Boneplate Breastplate\nOgreskull Boneplate Gauntlets\nOgreskull Boneplate Greathelm\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Blood: Death Strike reduces the cooldown of Vampiric Blood by 1 sec.\n(2) Set Frost: Activating Pillar of Frost generates 30 Runic Power.\n(2) Set Unholy: Your pet deals 120% additional damage while Dark Transformation is active.\n(4) Set Blood: While Vampiric Blood is active, your Blood Shield cannot be reduced below 3% of your maximum health.\n(4) Set Frost: While Pillar of Frost is active, your special attacks trap a soul in your rune weapon. When Pillar of Frost fades, your rune weapon discharges the souls at your current target, dealing (3.51% of Attack Power)% damage per soul.\n(4) Set Unholy: When you activate Dark Transformation, 1 of your runes are automatically refreshed.\nSell Price:" }
